    "verified_answer": "576.6 cm^2",
    "issue": "Exact surface area is 576.648... cm^2, which rounds to 576.6. Raw GT 577.0 follows if slant sqrt(218) is first rounded to 14.8 and the perimeter is then taken as 40.8; note intermediate rounding.",
    "reasoning": "Front trapezoid area=(10+3)*13/2=84.5 cm^2; slant side y=sqrt(218). Prism SA=2*84.5+10*(10+3+13+sqrt(218))=576.648... cm^2."
  }
